{"id":"571734","name":"腌雪里蕻","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/571734/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"雪里蕻","amount":"20斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"食盐","amount":"6两"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"雪菜洗净倒挂晾晒。","img":"images/571734/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"晒2天下雨了，全部淋了雨，洗净，倒挂在室内阳台晾晒了一天，家里有暖气，貌似比晒太阳干的还快。","img":"images/571734/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"晒3天的样子。","img":"images/571734/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"备好的咸菜坛子。","img":"images/571734/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"去掉根。","img":"images/571734/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"简单摊开。","img":"images/571734/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取食盐。","img":"images/571734/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒食盐。","img":"images/571734/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"均匀裹上食盐。","img":"images/571734/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"揉搓，揉出菜汁即可。","img":"images/571734/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放坛子里。","img":"images/571734/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"全部揉好放好。","img":"images/571734/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"用保鲜袋包住坛子口。","img":"images/571734/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"密封起来，放一边发酵20多天里可以啦。","img":"images/571734/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"制作过程不带一点水和油脂。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}